<title>USA: Anchor says analysts views are conservative.</title>
<headline>Anchor says analysts views are conservative.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anchor Gaming said Monday it believes, based on preliminary internal financial reports for the months of April and May, that analysts' estimates for the current quarter's profits may be conservative.</p>
<p>The company's earnings per share for the same period a year ago was $0.54. Anaylsts consensus for the fourth quarter are for $0.69 per share, according to First Call.</p>
<p>Anchor Gaming operates gaming machines and casinos.</p>
<p>No further information was immediately available.</p>
